IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BPRDVAL.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-CFG.
   05 WS-HOME-CFG PIC X(80).
   05 WS-BIZDATE PIC 9(08).
   05 WS-CURRENCY PIC X(03).
   05 WS-JRN-GEN PIC 9(09).
   05 WS-CFG-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(05).
01 WS-INIT-ST PIC X(02).
COPY "BPRODO".

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-PRODUCT PIC X(04).
01 LS-STATUS PIC X(02).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-PRODUCT LS-STATUS.
    MOVE "00" TO LS-STATUS
    CALL "BCFG" USING WS-CFG
    CALL "BPRODQ" USING LS-PRODUCT WS-BIZDATE BK-PROD-OUT
    IF PQ-RC = "35"
        CALL "BPROD" USING WS-COUNT WS-INIT-ST
        CALL "BPRODQ" USING LS-PRODUCT WS-BIZDATE BK-PROD-OUT
    END-IF
    EVALUATE PQ-RC
        WHEN "00" MOVE "00" TO LS-STATUS
        WHEN "35" MOVE "35" TO LS-STATUS
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "20" TO LS-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.
